  "id": "stellar-firma",
  "title": "Stellar Firma",
  "subtitle": "Build your planet, keep in line? Also clones.",
  "description": "“Build your planet, keep in line… also clones.\" Stellar Firma is a weekly Science Fiction, Comedy podcast following the misadventures of Stellar Firma Ltd.'s highest born but lowest achieving planetary designer Trexel Geistman and his bewildered clone assistant David 7. Join them each episode as they attempt to take listener submissions and craft them into the galaxy's most luxurious, most expensive and most questionably designed bespoke planets. However, with Trexel's corporate shark of a line manager Hartro Piltz breathing down their necks and I.M.O.G.E.N., the station's omnipresent and omniinvasive stationwide A.I. monitoring those necks to within 3 decimal places, they'll be lucky to make it a week before being slurried and recycled into raw human resources. Over 76 Episodes to enjoy in this long form audio drama. For more information on Stellar Firma and our award winning fiction podcasts, visit www.rustyquill.com Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
